Bulk Locator Addition Using CSV File:
Challenge: While adding locators in bulk using a CSV file, the records were successfully created on the server. However, the height, depth, and width fields were automatically set to 0 instead of being left empty. Because of this, the 3D layout data failed to load properly and resulted in an error.

Resolution: A SQL query was written to update the affected locators by replacing the values 0 with NULL (empty) for the fields height, depth, and width, based on the locator ID range. After executing the query, the 3D layout data reflected correctly without any errors.

